{"seq":3,"slug":"packaging-loss-prevention","title":"包装与操作改进驱动的损失预防","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/shipping-damage-freight-claims/claim-insight-prevention/packaging-loss-prevention","wordCount":2628,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"包装与操作改进驱动的损失预防\">包装与操作改进驱动的损失预防</h1><p>某品类在六个月内累计损失 47,200 美元，其中 63% 的损失集中在一个损伤形态上：外箱完好，但内部机器的散热片支架断裂。索赔做得很好，回收率 52%，追回约 24,500 美元。但如果换一种内衬结构，这类损伤本可以基本消失——每件成本增加 0.34 美元，年化约 4,100 美元，投资回收期不到一个月。<strong>理赔做得再好，也只是把损失的一部分追回来；把损失本身消掉，收益是全部。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>损失预防与理赔追偿的关系是<strong>互补而非替代</strong>。两者覆盖的是不同的损失区间：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>区间</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>应对方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>低于免赔额与处理成本</td>\n<td>金额小、发生频次高</td>\n<td>只能靠预防消除，索赔不经济</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在承运人责任范围内</td>\n<td>可索赔，但受上限约束</td>\n<td>追偿 + 预防并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超出承运人上限且不在承保范围</td>\n<td>如包装不充分所致</td>\n<td><strong>只能靠预防</strong>，无任何追偿路径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三行是这个环节存在的硬理由：<strong>包装不充分、固有瑕疵、延误引起这三类损失在承运人与保险人两侧都被排除</strong>（见 <a href=\"../cargo-insurance-claim/deductible-exclusion-handle\">免赔额与除外责任的处理</a>），它们构成的敞口没有任何外部承担者。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[损失数据] --&gt; B[根因分类]&#10;  B --&gt; C{根因归属}&#10;  C --&gt;|包装设计| D[包装规格改进]&#10;  C --&gt;|装箱操作| E[操作SOP改进]&#10;  C --&gt;|承运商作业| F[承运商约谈/换商]&#10;  C --&gt;|交接记录缺失| G[流程与设备改进]&#10;  D --&gt; H[小批量验证]&#10;  E --&gt; H&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I{损失率下降}&#10;  I --&gt;|显著| J[全量推广]&#10;  I --&gt;|不显著| K[回退或换方案]&#10;  J --&gt; A&#10;  K --&gt; A\">graph TD\n  A[损失数据] --&gt; B[根因分类]\n  B --&gt; C{根因归属}\n  C --&gt;|包装设计| D[包装规格改进]\n  C --&gt;|装箱操作| E[操作SOP改进]\n  C --&gt;|承运商作业| F[承运商约谈/换商]\n  C --&gt;|交接记录缺失| G[流程与设备改进]\n  D --&gt; H[小批量验证]\n  E --&gt; H\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I{损失率下降}\n  I --&gt;|显著| J[全量推广]\n  I --&gt;|不显著| K[回退或换方案]\n  J --&gt; A\n  K --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"根因分类-把-破损-拆到可行动\">根因分类：把&quot;破损&quot;拆到可行动</h2><p>&quot;破损&quot;不是一个可行动的根因。要产出动作，必须把它拆到能指向具体改动的粒度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"七类可行动的损伤形态下面这张分类表按损伤形态对应到典型根因与动作-是这套系统的核心资产\">七类可行动的损伤形态下面这张分类表按损伤形态对应到典型根因与动作，是这套系统的核心资产。</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>损伤形态</th>\n<th>典型根因</th>\n<th>改进动作</th>\n<th>验证指标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>外箱塌陷、内部完好</td>\n<td>堆码强度不足、单位面积承压超限</td>\n<td>提高纸箱边压强度、加隔板</td>\n<td>塌陷率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外箱完好、内部支架断裂</td>\n<td>冲击传递、内衬缓冲不足</td>\n<td>增加缓冲结构、限制内容物位移</td>\n<td>内部损伤率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边角压溃</td>\n<td>边角缓冲缺失</td>\n<td>加护角、角衬</td>\n<td>边角损伤率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>水湿、霉变</td>\n<td>防潮措施不足、集装箱凝露</td>\n<td>干燥剂、防潮内衬、通风选择</td>\n<td>水湿率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整件丢失</td>\n<td>高价值标识明显、中转环节多</td>\n<td>去品牌化包装、选择更少中转的路径</td>\n<td>丢失率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>封条破损后短少</td>\n<td>中转装卸环节监管不足</td>\n<td>换用一次性封条、增加途中检查点</td>\n<td>短少率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>托盘散垛</td>\n<td>缠绕膜与固定不足</td>\n<td>缠绕层数、打包带、防滑垫</td>\n<td>散垛率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>&quot;外箱完好、内部支架断裂&quot;这类损伤最值得做专项</strong>，因为它同时满足三个条件：发生率高（振动与冲击是运输的主应力）、根因明确（缓冲设计）、改进可验证（对比测试）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"包装验证-用测试规程替代经验\">包装验证：用测试规程替代经验</h2><p>包装改进最大的争议是&quot;改了到底有没有用&quot;。靠实际运输数据验证需要数月且受环境噪声干扰，因此行业使用<strong>包装性能测试规程</strong>作为前置验证手段。ISTA（International Safe Transit Association）发布的测试序列是市场通用标准，其中与跨境电商包裹最相关的是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>ISTA 3A</strong>：面向 150 lb（70 kg）及以下的<strong>包裹运输系统</strong>，适用于以独立包裹形式经空运或陆运的运输，覆盖标准、小型、扁平、细长四类包装形态；其方法包含随机振动、按包装重量分级的跌落、以及可选的温湿度预处理（见 <a href=\"https://ista.org/test_procedures.php\">ISTA 官方测试规程页</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>ISTA 6-Amazon 系列</strong>：面向特定分销体系的两套测试——**SIOC（Ships in Own Container）**用于无需亚马逊二次包装直发的商品，<strong>Over-Boxing</strong> 用于 70 lb（32 kg）及以下、由亚马逊装入外箱的商品。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>工程含义很直接：<strong>包装性能测试报告同时服务于两个目的——验证改进有效性，以及在索赔中击穿&quot;包装不充分&quot;的抗辩。</strong> 一个 SKU 如果没有测试记录，它在承运人侧与保险侧的抗辩权都是敞开的（见 <a href=\"../loss-damage-determine/damage-loss-evidence\">货损与丢件的证据采集与损失界定</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"改进的验证设计\">改进的验证设计</h3><p>验证一次包装改进是否真的有效，需要在数据采集侧做两件事：<strong>固定分组</strong>与<strong>足够样本</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计要素</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>对照组</td>\n<td>同一航线、同一品类、同时段保留旧包装批次</td>\n<td>排除季节与航线差异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样本量</td>\n<td>每组至少数百件，或按基线破损率反推</td>\n<td>小样本差异是噪声</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>观测指标</td>\n<td>该损伤形态的件数率，而非总破损率</td>\n<td>总率被其它形态稀释</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>观测窗口</td>\n<td>覆盖完整的运输周期与至少一个季节转折</td>\n<td>单季数据不可外推</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>判定</td>\n<td>用比例的置信区间判断差异是否显著</td>\n<td>避免把波动当成果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>所需样本量</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{所需样本量} \\approx \\frac{2(z_{\\alpha/2} + z_\\beta)^2 \\, \\bar{p}(1-\\bar{p})}{\\Delta^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">所需样本量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2453em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5593em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7452em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7622em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为基线破损率、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 为希望检出的绝对下降幅度。<strong>这个公式的实用价值在于反向回答&quot;这次改进值不值得做一次正式验证&quot;</strong>：如果基线破损率只有 0.3%，要检出 0.15% 的下降需要上十万件样本——此时更经济的做法是先做实验室测试（ISTA），只在测试通过后做小批量试运。</p>\n<h3 id=\"改进项的登记与追踪\">改进项的登记与追踪</h3><p>包装与操作改进是持续动作而非一次性项目，因此每一项改动都应以记录的形式进入系统，包含改动内容、生效时间、影响范围与验证结论。下面的表结构把&quot;改动&quot;与&quot;损失观测&quot;显式关联，使验证可以自动进行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE prevention_change (&#10;  change_id        BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  change_type      TEXT        NOT NULL,  -- packaging_spec|sop|carrier_switch|equipment&#10;  sku_scope        TEXT        NOT NULL,  -- 适用 SKU 或品类范围&#10;  lane_scope       TEXT,                  -- 适用航线，NULL 表示全部&#10;  description      TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_from   TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_to     TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  unit_cost_delta  NUMERIC(10,4),         -- 每件成本增量，可为负&#10;  test_report_ref  TEXT,                  -- ISTA 等测试报告引用&#10;  status           TEXT        NOT NULL CHECK (status IN (&#39;trial&#39;,&#39;adopted&#39;,&#39;reverted&#39;)),&#10;  UNIQUE (change_type, sku_scope, lane_scope, effective_from)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 用生效时间窗口把改动与损失观测切成前后对照&#10;CREATE VIEW change_effect_observation AS&#10;SELECT c.change_id,&#10;       count(*) FILTER (WHERE f.determined_at &lt;  c.effective_from) AS pre_units,&#10;       count(*) FILTER (WHERE f.determined_at &gt;= c.effective_from) AS post_units,&#10;       count(*) FILTER (WHERE f.determined_at &lt;  c.effective_from AND f.severity_tier &lt;&gt; &#39;packaging_only&#39;) AS pre_loss_units,&#10;       count(*) FILTER (WHERE f.determined_at &gt;= c.effective_from AND f.severity_tier &lt;&gt; &#39;packaging_only&#39;) AS post_loss_units&#10;FROM prevention_change c&#10;JOIN loss_finding f ON f.sku_id::text LIKE c.sku_scope || &#39;%&#39;&#10;GROUP BY c.change_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> prevention_change</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  change_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  change_type      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- packaging_spec|sop|carrier_switch|equipment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_scope        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 适用 SKU 或品类范围</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lane_scope       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 适用航线，NULL 表示全部</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_to     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  unit_cost_delta  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 每件成本增量，可为负</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  test_report_ref  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ISTA 等测试报告引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shi