rk:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">determined_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">effective_from</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">severity_tier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'packaging_only'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pre_loss_units,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">determined_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">effective_from</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">severity_tier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'packaging_only'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> post_loss_units</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prevention_change c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loss_finding f </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIKE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_scope</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '%'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">change_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条视图把&quot;改动&quot;与&quot;该改动生效前后的损失件数&quot;直接对照。注意 <code>pre_units</code> 与 <code>post_units</code> 必须都达到样本量要求才能出结论，否则 <code>status</code> 应停留在 <code>trial</code> 而不是提前标记 <code>adopted</code>——<strong>提前宣布改进成功是这类项目最常见的自欺形式</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"操作-sop-与交接记录\">操作 SOP 与交接记录</h2><p>相当一部分损失不是包装问题，而是<strong>操作与记录问题</strong>。这类问题的特征是&quot;损失金额不大但争议成本极高&quot;——因为没有记录，责任段无法判定，最终只能内部核销。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>常见操作缺陷</th>\n<th>SOP 修正</th>\n<th>对应损失类型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>出库装箱</td>\n<td>未记录封条号、未拍照</td>\n<td>强制字段：封条号 + 装箱前影像</td>\n<td>短少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>装柜</td>\n<td>未做柜内固定与填缝</td>\n<td>检查清单：固定方式 + 照片</td>\n<td>运输中移位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交接</td>\n<td>交接凭证仅签数量不签状态</td>\n<td>凭证增加箱况勾选（三态）</td>\n<td>责任段无法判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卸货</td>\n<td>未在卸货前拍照</td>\n<td>卸货前外箱照为必采项</td>\n<td>交付前损伤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开箱</td>\n<td>先剪封条后拍照</td>\n<td>调整顺序：封条照 → 拆封 → 开箱过程</td>\n<td>破损与短少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>入库</td>\n<td>异常仅记文字不拍照</td>\n<td>异常报告必附影像</td>\n<td>全部形态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>&quot;先剪封条后拍照&quot;是一个高频且代价高昂的操作缺陷。</strong> 封条一旦剪断，短少索赔中权重最高的证据就永久消失了（见 <a href=\"../loss-damage-determine/damage-loss-evidence\">货损与丢件的证据采集与损失界定</a> 中的封条规则）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"把-sop-做成系统约束而非文档\">把 SOP 做成系统约束而非文档</h3><p>SOP 写在文档里会被绕过，做成系统约束才会被执行。具体做法是把上表中的&quot;修正&quot;映射到现场作业系统里的<strong>必填字段与拍照位</strong>：现场人员完成作业时，缺失必填项无法提交，照片位未上传无法进入下一步。这比培训与检查有效得多，且产生的结构化数据直接进入损失分析的数据集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本收益的判断\">成本收益的判断</h2><p>预防投入必须小于它避免的损失。判断时需要区分三类成本与两类收益。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三类成本与两类收益\">三类成本与两类收益</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项目</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>材料成本增量</td>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>每件包装成本增加 × 年出货量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包装作业时间增量</td>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>增加的装配工时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>验证与测试费用</td>\n<td>成本（一次性）</td>\n<td>实验室测试、小批量试运</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>追偿收益减少</td>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>破损减少意味着可索赔金额也减少（净效果仍为正）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直接损失减少</td>\n<td>收益</td>\n<td>减少的赔付 + 减少的核销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>衍生成本减少</td>\n<td>收益</td>\n<td>客诉、重发、退款、信誉损失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>第四项是最容易被忽略的</strong>：破损减少，可向承运人索赔的金额也随之减少，因此不能把&quot;避免的损失全额&quot;当作收益，而应扣除本可追回的部分。正确的净收益是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Net</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Net} = \\Delta L \\times (1 - r) - \\Delta C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Net</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 为减少的认定损失，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 为该品类当前的回收率（含保险赔付），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 为增加的包装与作业成本。用 <a href=\"../carrier-freight-claim/carrier-claim-recover-rate\">承运商索赔成功率与回款</a> 中的六层漏斗数据可以直接取出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>损失预防与索赔追偿<strong>互补而非替代</strong>：低于免赔额的小额损失、以及包装不充分/固有瑕疵/延误引起这三类双侧排除的损失，<strong>无任何追偿路径，只能靠预防</strong>。</li>\n<li>&quot;破损&quot;不是可行动的根因；根因分类要拆到能指向具体改动（塌陷/内部断裂/边角/水湿/丢失/短少/散垛）的粒度。</li>\n<li>包装验证应使用行业测试规程（ISTA 3A 面向 70 kg 及以下包裹，6-Amazon SIOC/Over-Boxing 面向特定分销体系）；<strong>测试报告同时用于验证有效性与击穿&quot;包装不充分&quot;抗辩</strong>。</li>\n<li>改进验证需要对照组、足够样本、针对特定损伤形态的指标，并用比例的置信区间判定；先实验室测试再小批量试运通常更经济。</li>\n<li>操作与记录缺陷造成的损失&quot;金额小但争议成本极高&quot;；<strong>SOP 应做成现场系统的必填字段与拍照位</strong>，而不是文档。</li>\n<li>成本收益判断中必须扣除&quot;本可追回的部分&quot;：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Net</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Net} = \\Delta L \\times (1-r) - \\Delta C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Net</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>至此四条主线闭环：损失被认定、被追偿、被保险补足，最后被预防。回到 <a href=\"../\">hub 引言</a> 可以看到这四章如何在不同的读者路径上被组合使用。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"包装与操作改进驱动的损失预防","id":"包装与操作改进驱动的损失预防"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"根因分类：把\"破损\"拆到可行动","id":"根因分类-把-破损-拆到可行动"},{"level":3,"text":"七类可行动的损伤形态下面这张分类表按损伤形态对应到典型根因与动作，是这套系统的核心资产。","id":"七类可行动的损伤形态下面这张分类表按损伤形态对应到典型根因与动作-是这套系统的核心资产"},{"level":2,"text":"包装验证：用测试规程替代经验","id":"包装验证-用测试规程替代经验"},{"level":3,"text":"改进的验证设计","id":"改进的验证设计"},{"level":3,"text":"改进项的登记与追踪","id":"改进项的登记与追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"操作 SOP 与交接记录","id":"操作-sop-与交接记录"},{"level":3,"text":"把 SOP 做成系统约束而非文档","id":"把-sop-做成系统约束而非文档"},{"level":2,"text":"成本收益的判断","id":"成本收益的判断"},{"level":3,"text":"三类成本与两类收益","id":"三类成本与两类收益"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"理赔数据反哺承运商选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/shipping-damage-freight-claims/claim-insight-prevention/claim-data-carrier-score"},"next":null}